sequenceDiagram
    participant USER as User
    participant FE as NvidiaVoiceChat
    participant API as /api/voice/chat
    participant NV as NVIDIA Nemotron VoiceChat
    participant FB as Fallback Pipeline

    USER->>FE: Press mic button
    FE->>FE: navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia()
    FE->>FE: MediaRecorder.start() — record webm

    USER->>FE: Release mic button
    FE->>FE: MediaRecorder.stop()
    Note over FE: emotion → "thinking"

    FE->>API: POST /api/voice/chat\nFormData {audio: webm blob, system_prompt}
    API->>API: Convert audio to base64

    API->>NV: POST integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1/audio/chat\n{model: nemotron-voicechat, audio_base64}

    alt Primary path — VoiceChat API success
        NV-->>API: {text, audio: base64 WAV, userTranscript}
        API-->>FE: {text, audio, userTranscript, model}
        FE->>FE: Decode base64 WAV → Blob → Audio element
        FE->>USER: Play audio response
        Note over FE: emotion → "speaking"
    else Fallback path — VoiceChat API fails
        NV-->>API: Error response
        API->>FB: fallbackPipeline(audioBase64, systemPrompt)
        FB->>NV: LLM call: meta/llama-3.1-70b-instruct
        FB->>NV: TTS call: resembleai/chatterbox-multilingual-tts
        FB-->>FE: {text, audio, model: "fallback-pipeline"}
        FE->>USER: Play fallback audio
    end

    FE->>FE: Add messages to conversation history
    Note over FE: emotion → "listening"